description=The easiest way to use SuSFS on KernelSU. Strong hiding by default with built-in spoofing and hiding scripts, config files and toggle switches for everyday use, a built-in script manager for power users. LKM support for OnePlus/OPPO/Realme devices without native SUSFS.
